	(text "KONVENSI & PENEMPATAN TP (layout S9):\n Pad bulat SMD D2,0 mm bare-copper (TestPoint_Pad_D2.0mm — DN-S7-05);\n  pitch antar-TP >= 2,54 mm; TIDAK di bawah komponen / modul M1 / RSH1;\n  tersebar per zona mengikuti sheet asal netnya.\n TP_GND = PGND star (BATTERY-) — referensi umum DMM (DN-S7-02; AGND/\n  DGND equipotensial via NT1/NT2).\n TP_ESTOP = node E_STOP_SENSE (2,96 V loop-OK / 0 V terbuka — §57)\n  (DN-S7-03). TP_UART_TX/RX = UART0 GPIO1/3 console debug — BUKAN\n  RS485 (bus punya TP_A/B sendiri) (DN-S7-04).\n TP_VBAT mengetuk VBAT_DIV pra-R22 (DN-S3-02) — verifikasi kalibrasi\n  3-titik 45/50/54 V §53.\n TP_BAT+ = 45-54 V: creepage SELV >= 2,5 mm ke net lain & jauh\n  >= 6,4 mm dari MAINS. Stub analog (TP_VBAT/SHUNT_K±/ACS) pendek\n  <= 5 mm, tidak melintas zona SW modul; TP_UART/EN/IO0 di tepi zona\n  digital utk probe ground-clip pendek.\n ASM-001: DMM hitam TP_GND, merah TP_5V — set trimpot M1 = 5,00 V ±2%."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215 250 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a66cccc4-83bb-4cfe-9927-45d638e24948")	)
	(text "INVENTARIS CONNECTOR TEPI §40 + M5 (1/2) — SEMUA hadir (netlist proof):\n J_BAT — 2-pin 5,08 (BAT+/BAT-) — sheet 01 — feed suplai elektronik ~65 mA\n J_SHUNT — 2 pad baut M5 DALAM footprint RSH1 (BATTERY- star / SYS- 100 A) — 03\n J_ACS1 — 2-pin >= 30 A (ACS1 IP+/IP-) — 05 — jalur force pour dua sisi\n J_ACS2 — 2-pin >= 30 A (ACS2 IP+/IP-) — 05 — idem J_ACS1\n J_PZEM_AC — 2-pin 5,08 (L_AC/N_AC MAINS + F3 1 A slow) — 10 — zona mains\n J_ESTOP — 2-pin 5,08 (+5V_RELAY/RELAY_RET loop NC) — 09 — sisi SUPPLAI coil\n J_RELAY — 2-pin 5,08 (kontak dry COM/NO K1) — 09 — aktuator kontaktor ekst."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ef946fc-d1e5-42f3-87d8-26504409ff9d")	)
	(text "INVENTARIS (2/2) + CATATAN M5:\n J_PROGRAM — header 6-pin 2,54 (3V3/GND/TX/RX/EN/IO0) — 02\n J_EXP — header 7-pin 2,54 (3V3/GND/GPIO13/23/33/36/39) — 11 (sheet ini)\n J_I2C_EXP — header 4-pin 2,54 (3V3/GND/SDA/SCL) — 06\n J1 — USB-C 16-pin (VBUS_5V/DP/DM + CC 5,1k) — 02 — VBUS TIDAK = +5V\n J_RS485 — 3-pin 5,08 (A/B/GND + TVS SM712) — 07\n J_CAN — 3-pin 5,08 (CANH/CANL/GND + TVS CDSOT23-T24CAN) — 08\n CATATAN: terminal baut RSH1 = antarmuka daya 100 A (J_SHUNT\n  terintegrasi footprint); J1 & J_PZEM_AC = antarmuka data/daya utama."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 250 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f662d8f-87db-42f0-8ecf-f7482ede2da3")	)
	(text "CHECKLIST GATE S7 — §40 + §41 + M5 (target 100% hijau):\n§40/M5 CONNECTOR (13/13 hadir — netlist proof): J_BAT(01) · J1 USB-C(02)\n  · J_PROGRAM(02) · J_SHUNT = pad baut M5 dalam RSH1(03) · J_ACS1(05) ·\n  J_ACS2(05) · J_I2C_EXP(06) · J_RS485(07) · J_CAN(08) · J_ESTOP(09) ·\n  J_RELAY(09) · J_PZEM_AC(10) · J_EXP(11 — sheet ini).\n§41 TEST POINT (21/21): 15 nama tercantum task spec + 5 audit\n  (TP_RELAY_RET, TP_ACS1_ADC, TP_ACS2_ADC, TP_EN, TP_IO0) +\n  TP_5V_RELAY penutup hitungan '16 §41 / total 21' (DN-S7-01:\n  verifikasi rail rantai E-stop — kondisi 4 §57 + power-up §51).\nM5 EKSPANSI: GPIO36/39 input-only (ADC1) — dilarang drive-out; header\n  I2C eksternal bebas alamat 0x40/0x44/0x68 (J_I2C_EXP, sheet 06).\nERC PASCA-S7: 0 ERROR (pin_not_driven GPIO36/39 tertutup pin pasif\n  J_EXP — preseden U1.6 S3) · 0 DANGLING · sisa 3 lib legacy +\n  2 mismatch (review S8) — S8-READY."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215 20 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bcdab0c5-34e5-493c-a20b-678b1caf679a")	)
	(text_box "11_CONNECTORS_TESTPOINTS — inventaris connector tepi §40 + 21 test point\n§41 + audit M5 (S7).\nKOMPONEN BARU: J_EXP header 7-pin 2,54 (3V3/GND/GPIO13/23/33/36/39 — M5\n  audit; kontrapart 5 label dangling terakhir GPIO13/23/33/36/39 -> ERC\n  0 error, 0 dangling — S8-ready) + 21 TP pad bulat SMD D2,0 mm\n  (TestPoint:TestPoint_Pad_D2.0mm) — terjangkau probe multimeter,\n  tidak di bawah komponen (§41).\nSETIAP TP MENETUK NET EKSISTING (tidak ada net baru): 5 POWER (TP_5V,\n  TP_3V3, TP_GND, TP_BAT+, TP_5V_RELAY) · 5 ANALOG (TP_VBAT di\n  VBAT_DIV pra-R22 DN-S3-02, TP_SHUNT_K+/-, TP_ACS1/2_ADC) · 6 KOMUNIKASI\n  (TP_RS485_A/B, TP_CAN_H/L, TP_UART_TX/RX = UART0 console) · 5 KONTROL/\n  SAFETY (TP_ESTOP, TP_RELAY_CTRL, TP_RELAY_RET, TP_EN, TP_IO0) — bukti\n  eksak netlist §23.\nSEMUA connector tepi lain sudah berada di sheet fungsionalnya —\n  inventaris lengkap 13 konektor + catatan penempatan di sheet ini\n  (gate §40/§41/M5 = netlist proof)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
